  "name": "Hawaiian Haystacks",
  "subtitle": "Warm chicken gravy over rice with crisp, colorful toppings",
  "description": "A quick layered rice dinner with creamy chicken sauce, tropical fruit, crunchy noodles, vegetables, cheese, coconut, and almonds.",
